1
00:00:07,240 --> 00:00:12,080
=Fatal Proximity to Him=

2
00:00:12,080 --> 00:00:14,120
=Episode 2=

3
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:17,160
You're sure they're both in there?

4
00:00:17,280 --> 00:00:17,960
Rest assured.

5
00:00:18,160 --> 00:00:19,160
Just wait

6
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:20,640
for the show tomorrow.

7
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:22,080
Hey!

8
00:00:22,360 --> 00:00:23,160
What are you doing?

9
00:00:27,280 --> 00:00:28,000
Somebody help!

10
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:28,960
Help!

11
00:00:29,240 --> 00:00:30,040
- Stop yelling.
- Help!

12
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:31,080
There's no one out there.

13
00:00:32,600 --> 00:00:34,000
(Low Battery. Shutting Down.)
(My phone's dead too.)

14
00:00:36,160 --> 00:00:36,680
Hey!

15
00:00:36,760 --> 00:00:37,240
You...

16
00:00:37,240 --> 00:00:38,040
Stay away from me!

17
00:00:38,960 --> 00:00:41,320
I heard all about what happened
at your old school.

18
00:00:41,680 --> 00:00:43,040
Don't think just because
we're locked in here,

19
00:00:43,040 --> 00:00:44,480
you can do whatever you want to me.

20
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:51,240
And what exactly do you think
I'd do to you?

21
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:53,080
That's irrelevant.

22
00:00:53,560 --> 00:00:55,160
We should be figuring out
how to get out of here.

23
00:00:55,720 --> 00:00:56,920
The door's locked from the outside.

24
00:00:58,200 --> 00:00:59,200
Our only option

25
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:00,880
is to wait until someone comes tomorrow

26
00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:01,760
and lets us out.

27
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:04,760
Why would anyone lock me in here...

28
00:01:08,640 --> 00:01:09,920
Why would anyone lock you in here?

29
00:01:10,720 --> 00:01:12,640
What makes you so sure I'm the one
they wanted to lock up?

30
00:01:13,120 --> 00:01:14,240
You embarrassed Ding Jie

31
00:01:14,240 --> 00:01:15,520
in front of the whole class today.

32
00:01:16,080 --> 00:01:17,040
He must've wanted to teach you a lesson

33
00:01:17,040 --> 00:01:17,960
and locked you in here.

34
00:01:18,160 --> 00:01:18,920
I just got dragged into it.

35
00:01:19,400 --> 00:01:20,480
You're such a jinx.

36
00:01:20,840 --> 00:01:22,280
Nothing good ever happens
when you're around.

37
00:01:22,680 --> 00:01:23,800
Say whatever you want.

38
00:01:26,720 --> 00:01:27,520
This crutch

39
00:01:27,960 --> 00:01:28,800
is the dividing line.

40
00:01:29,080 --> 00:01:31,120
Tonight, you stay on that side.
I'll stay on this side.

41
00:01:31,360 --> 00:01:32,360
Neither of us crosses the line.

42
00:01:43,720 --> 00:01:45,000
That day...

43
00:01:46,320 --> 00:01:47,760
why did you give me twenty yuan?

44
00:02:06,360 --> 00:02:07,360
Do you need help?

45
00:02:08,200 --> 00:02:10,000
I can call you a ride to the hospital.

46
00:02:12,160 --> 00:02:12,680
No.

47
00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:17,240
Want me to call your family?

48
00:02:20,320 --> 00:02:21,720
What if I'm just some punk?

49
00:02:21,880 --> 00:02:23,240
Aren't you afraid helping me
might backfire?

50
00:02:24,320 --> 00:02:25,320
Not every rescue story

51
00:02:25,640 --> 00:02:26,640
ends like The Scorpion and the Frog.

52
00:02:27,520 --> 00:02:28,520
Remember The Lion and the Mouse?

53
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:36,880
♪I hide my racing heart without a sound♪

54
00:02:38,800 --> 00:02:43,440
♪I close my eyes and pretend
the story's been reset♪

55
00:02:44,920 --> 00:02:47,560
♪I steer clear of every path
that leads to you♪

56
00:02:47,920 --> 00:02:50,720
♪Trying to outrun the storm
we're destined for♪

57
00:02:51,400 --> 00:02:53,640
♪I thought if I didn't hear, see,
or speak of you♪

58
00:02:53,640 --> 00:02:57,120
♪I could cut every thread
that ties us together♪

59
00:02:58,280 --> 00:03:03,360
♪Through the endless night,
I guard my only secret♪

60
00:03:05,080 --> 00:03:06,280
(What he just told me...)

61
00:03:06,560 --> 00:03:08,080
(Why don't I remember any of it?)

62
00:03:08,920 --> 00:03:11,240
It was just a piece of cake.
No big deal.

63
00:03:11,920 --> 00:03:13,480
But why were you

64
00:03:13,720 --> 00:03:14,640
beaten up so badly that day?

65
00:03:17,080 --> 00:03:18,280
Are you worried about me?

66
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:19,560
Of course not.

67
00:03:20,720 --> 00:03:22,320
I'm just nosy.

68
00:03:22,960 --> 00:03:24,280
Being nosy is human nature.

69
00:03:24,640 --> 00:03:25,640
Actually, never mind.

70
00:03:25,640 --> 00:03:26,360
You don't have to tell me.

71
00:03:26,440 --> 00:03:28,280
Once we get out tomorrow,

72
00:03:28,280 --> 00:03:29,760
we'll stay out of each other's lives.

73
00:03:29,960 --> 00:03:30,400
Okay?

74
00:03:33,880 --> 00:03:34,400
Okay?

75
00:03:36,400 --> 00:03:36,880
Okay.

76
00:03:48,160 --> 00:03:49,040
Are you afraid of the dark?

77
00:03:50,080 --> 00:03:51,040
Afraid of the dark? Please.

78
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:52,920
I'm not scared.

79
00:04:17,960 --> 00:04:18,800
What are you doing?

80
00:04:25,920 --> 00:04:26,880
You'll see.

81
00:04:51,320 --> 00:04:52,720
Just pretend we're camping,

82
00:04:53,760 --> 00:04:54,520
looking up at the stars.

83
00:04:57,160 --> 00:04:58,000
(So beautiful.)

84
00:05:10,760 --> 00:05:12,000
Do you know what
quantum entanglement is?

85
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:14,960
What's that?

86
00:05:15,720 --> 00:05:17,480
Two particles that have interacted

87
00:05:18,480 --> 00:05:19,840
can stay connected

88
00:05:20,240 --> 00:05:21,600
no matter how far apart they are.

89
00:05:23,960 --> 00:05:25,760
Do you think people can be
like that too?

90
00:05:27,640 --> 00:05:30,600
I don't know anything
about quantum entanglement.

91
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:33,120
But I do know what you are.

92
00:05:36,640 --> 00:05:37,880
Bad-boy entanglement.

93
00:05:52,200 --> 00:05:53,320
♪I miss you♪

94
00:05:53,480 --> 00:05:56,560
♪It is as natural as breathing♪

95
00:05:59,040 --> 00:06:00,160
♪I'm already hooked♪

96
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:03,720
♪Falling for you has become a habit♪

97
00:06:05,960 --> 00:06:09,120
♪The traces you left on my heart remain♪

98
00:06:09,320 --> 00:06:12,480
♪No busy signal can drown them out♪

99
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:17,920
♪No cold night wind can blow them away♪

100
00:06:20,920 --> 00:06:21,560
I'll keep the jacket.

101
00:06:22,160 --> 00:06:23,000
Get back behind the line.

102
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:26,000
♪I said goodbye to the carefree me♪

103
00:06:26,480 --> 00:06:29,880
♪Yet I keep looking back,
longing for the past♪

104
00:06:29,880 --> 00:06:31,760
(I can't get too close to him.)

105
00:06:33,400 --> 00:06:36,640
♪I swallowed every lie♪

106
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:40,280
♪And forgot how cold you became♪

107
00:06:40,480 --> 00:06:42,800
♪All my pain♪

108
00:06:43,480 --> 00:06:45,640
♪I buried it all deep inside♪

109
00:06:45,640 --> 00:06:47,680
♪Your greatest charm is all in my head♪

110
00:06:47,680 --> 00:06:49,440
♪It's all just my imagination♪

111
00:06:49,440 --> 00:06:51,200
♪I dreamed up every little moment♪

112
00:06:51,200 --> 00:06:53,000
♪The sweetness was never even real♪

113
00:06:53,080 --> 00:06:54,560
♪I became hysterical♪

114
00:06:54,560 --> 00:06:58,120
♪And little by little, I lost myself♪

115
00:06:58,360 --> 00:06:59,240
♪Completely♪

116
00:06:59,320 --> 00:07:01,440
♪Your greatest magic is my weakness♪

117
00:07:01,440 --> 00:07:03,080
♪I just can't control myself♪

118
00:07:03,160 --> 00:07:04,840
♪That's why I keep falling♪

119
00:07:04,840 --> 00:07:06,760
♪For a love that was never real♪

120
00:07:06,760 --> 00:07:08,880
♪I fought through every thorn alone♪

121
00:07:09,160 --> 00:07:12,520
♪I thought I could take it all on♪

122
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:15,560
♪I still ended up completely defeated♪

123
00:07:28,440 --> 00:07:31,440
♪Love gives us reckless courage♪

124
00:07:31,760 --> 00:07:34,760
♪I said goodbye to the carefree me♪

125
00:07:35,240 --> 00:07:39,880
♪Yet I keep looking back,
longing for the past♪

126
00:07:42,160 --> 00:07:45,400
♪I swallowed every lie♪

127
00:07:45,560 --> 00:07:48,800
♪And forgot how cold you became♪

128
00:07:49,040 --> 00:07:51,360
♪All my pain♪

129
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:54,160
♪I buried it all deep inside♪

130
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:09,320
Hey! What are you two doing?

131
00:08:10,040 --> 00:08:10,840
You're way too young

132
00:08:11,040 --> 00:08:12,160
to be sneaking out and spending
the night together.

133
00:08:12,680 --> 00:08:13,480
If you were my daughter,

134
00:08:13,920 --> 00:08:14,720
I'd break your legs.

135
00:08:14,960 --> 00:08:16,600
Ma'am, it's not what you think.

136
00:08:22,920 --> 00:08:24,000
Oh, she already has a broken leg.

137
00:08:25,520 --> 00:08:26,440
(Dear students,)

138
00:08:26,600 --> 00:08:27,640
(good morning.)

139
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:29,640
(Class 4, Senior Year)
(On this beautiful sunny morning,)

140
00:08:29,880 --> 00:08:31,400
(Be Your Best Self)
(let's welcome another brand-new day.)

141
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:34,160
(I'm today's announcer, Zhang Jinghang.)

142
00:08:34,640 --> 00:08:36,880
(And I'm today's announcer, Song Shuqi.)

143
00:08:36,960 --> 00:08:39,160
(We're happy to meet you
over the airwaves.)

144
00:08:39,200 --> 00:08:41,560
(Let's enjoy this
wonderful time together.)

145
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:42,920
Hey,

146
00:08:43,080 --> 00:08:43,840
(Outstanding Class; Honor Banner)
new guy.

147
00:08:44,600 --> 00:08:46,400
What were you two doing
in the equipment room?

148
00:08:46,760 --> 00:08:48,160
You didn't even hear
the door being locked?

149
00:08:49,320 --> 00:08:49,720
Well, well.

150
00:08:50,160 --> 00:08:50,800
(Exemplary Class)
He Lan,

151
00:08:51,120 --> 00:08:52,520
(Honor Banner)
you look a little worn out.

152
00:08:57,120 --> 00:08:59,160
(Academic Success)

153
00:09:02,800 --> 00:09:03,800
You didn't go home all night.

154
00:09:03,800 --> 00:09:04,760
Your mom must've freaked out.

155
00:09:05,560 --> 00:09:07,240
My mom had back-to-back surgeries
last night.

156
00:09:07,240 --> 00:09:08,240
She probably doesn't know.

157
00:09:08,840 --> 00:09:10,760
The homeroom teacher didn't say anything
about you and He Lan, right?

158
00:09:51,400 --> 00:09:51,760
Hey,

159
00:09:52,240 --> 00:09:53,360
there's a ballet this weekend.

160
00:09:53,480 --> 00:09:54,440
Want to go watch it together?

161
00:09:57,480 --> 00:09:58,280
Sure.

162
00:09:59,240 --> 00:10:01,400
Whoa!

163
00:10:02,240 --> 00:10:03,760
(I'm so jealous!)

164
00:10:21,440 --> 00:10:22,520
What did you think

165
00:10:22,840 --> 00:10:23,640
of the performance?

166
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:25,880
It was really good.

167
00:10:26,480 --> 00:10:28,400
I've wanted to watch it for a long time.

168
00:10:28,600 --> 00:10:29,440
I'm glad you liked it.

169
00:10:47,360 --> 00:10:47,960
Ma'am.

170
00:10:49,760 --> 00:10:50,680
You can have my seat.

171
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:51,800
- Oh, thank you.
- Here.

172
00:10:52,480 --> 00:10:53,240
Let me help you.

173
00:10:53,240 --> 00:10:53,800
Thank you.

174
00:10:58,200 --> 00:10:58,920
Ma'am,

175
00:10:59,120 --> 00:11:01,000
I think your zipper's open.

176
00:11:01,560 --> 00:11:02,080
Huh?

177
00:11:05,960 --> 00:11:06,680
Thank you,

178
00:11:06,680 --> 00:11:07,280
young man.

179
00:11:07,280 --> 00:11:08,080
No problem.

180
00:11:24,200 --> 00:11:25,920
There's still time before
the Dance Academy exam.

181
00:11:26,400 --> 00:11:27,880
I'm sure you'll recover by then.

182
00:11:29,120 --> 00:11:31,280
I still have so many moves
I need to practice before the exam.

183
00:11:32,240 --> 00:11:33,120
I don't even know

184
00:11:33,840 --> 00:11:34,760
if I can pull it off.

185
00:11:45,040 --> 00:11:46,120
Interfere with my business?

186
00:11:46,320 --> 00:11:47,080
You're gonna pay for that!

187
00:11:48,520 --> 00:11:49,240
Give me the crutch!

188
00:11:50,080 --> 00:11:50,600
Stay back!

189
00:11:52,200 --> 00:11:52,720
Stay back!

190
00:12:16,400 --> 00:12:17,040
Stop! Buddy!

191
00:12:17,040 --> 00:12:17,680
I'm sorry!

192
00:12:17,880 --> 00:12:18,720
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

193
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:21,560
Get lost.

194
00:12:33,280 --> 00:12:34,080
Where are you taking Xiyu?

195
00:12:35,120 --> 00:12:35,760
None of your business.

196
00:12:48,280 --> 00:12:49,160
(Where am I?)

197
00:12:56,120 --> 00:12:56,920
Where's Zhang Jinghang?

198
00:12:57,480 --> 00:12:58,680
Probably got beaten to death by now.

199
00:12:59,760 --> 00:13:01,320
You left him there all by himself?

200
00:13:02,800 --> 00:13:03,880
I have to go back for him.

201
00:13:04,120 --> 00:13:05,160
You care about him that much?

202
00:13:05,560 --> 00:13:06,520
What's it to you?

203
00:13:06,600 --> 00:13:07,640
He's nothing like you.

204
00:13:08,000 --> 00:13:09,560
He's going to be a doctor someday,

205
00:13:09,600 --> 00:13:10,880
not some gang leader.

206
00:13:13,280 --> 00:13:14,640
Then he should learn to be smarter.

207
00:13:15,240 --> 00:13:16,120
Take pictures and call the cops

208
00:13:16,440 --> 00:13:17,480
instead of trying to take on
those guys alone.

209
00:13:18,080 --> 00:13:19,320
If he can't even protect himself,

210
00:13:19,320 --> 00:13:20,120
how's he supposed to protect you?

211
00:13:20,120 --> 00:13:21,600
I can protect myself.

212
00:13:22,880 --> 00:13:24,000
Mind your own business.

213
00:13:27,520 --> 00:13:28,520
He's fine now.

214
00:13:30,440 --> 00:13:31,840
Those guys won't bother him again.

215
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:33,880
Glad to hear that.

216
00:13:34,320 --> 00:13:35,320
Then I can go home.

217
00:13:35,360 --> 00:13:36,520
You're gonna hop all the way home
like that?

218
00:13:36,640 --> 00:13:37,280
What else am I supposed to do?

219
00:13:37,800 --> 00:13:38,600
I'll take you home.

220
00:13:38,680 --> 00:13:39,240
No, thanks.

221
00:13:40,600 --> 00:13:41,520
I said no.

222
00:13:42,240 --> 00:13:42,920
Listen.

223
00:13:43,720 --> 00:13:45,240
Good girls falling for bad boys?

224
00:13:45,240 --> 00:13:46,640
That only happens in comics.

225
00:13:47,120 --> 00:13:48,080
I'm not falling for that cliche.

226
00:13:48,080 --> 00:13:49,920
(A Smile Welcomes All)

227
00:13:54,240 --> 00:13:54,720
You...

228
00:13:55,720 --> 00:13:56,960
You still have a fever?

229
00:14:05,760 --> 00:14:06,520
You're still sick.

230
00:14:07,040 --> 00:14:08,680
Stop trying to play the hero.

231
00:14:17,800 --> 00:14:20,640
(Academic Building)

232
00:14:20,640 --> 00:14:21,000
Hey,

233
00:14:21,080 --> 00:14:23,760
I saw Luo Xiyu and Zhang Jinghang
out together this weekend.

234
00:14:24,160 --> 00:14:25,040
Seriously?

235
00:14:25,320 --> 00:14:26,800
They're being pretty obvious about it.

236
00:14:27,000 --> 00:14:28,200
Aren't they afraid the teachers
will find out?

237
00:14:28,800 --> 00:14:30,680
They get good grades.
The teachers don't care.

238
00:14:32,960 --> 00:14:33,760
I'm telling you,

239
00:14:33,880 --> 00:14:34,600
those two...

240
00:14:35,480 --> 00:14:36,040
Come on.

241
00:14:36,280 --> 00:14:37,280
Let's get back to class.

242
00:14:58,360 --> 00:14:59,600
(So annoying.)

243
00:14:59,720 --> 00:15:01,840
(I can't believe you didn't get punished
for what happened in the room.)

244
00:15:11,200 --> 00:15:13,280
(I'll teach you a lesson this time.)

245
00:15:24,120 --> 00:15:25,120
(Women's Restroom)

246
00:15:25,120 --> 00:15:25,760
(Ah!)

247
00:15:26,040 --> 00:15:27,080
(My foot!)

248
00:15:38,040 --> 00:15:39,560
(Someone did something to Xiyu.)

249
00:15:39,600 --> 00:15:40,600
(She fell in the restroom.)

250
00:15:40,600 --> 00:15:41,680
(It looks pretty serious.)

251
00:15:41,720 --> 00:15:43,040
(Gate 2)
(She's unconscious.)

252
00:15:43,040 --> 00:15:44,720
(Emergency)

253
00:15:46,080 --> 00:15:46,840
Xiyu!

254
00:15:47,440 --> 00:15:48,200
Xiyu!

255
00:15:49,600 --> 00:15:50,240
Dr. Chen,

256
00:15:50,240 --> 00:15:51,360
(Luo Yingnan, Luo Xiyu's Mother)
what happened?

257
00:15:51,400 --> 00:15:52,640
We're not sure yet.

258
00:15:52,960 --> 00:15:54,000
She injured the back of her head,

259
00:15:54,040 --> 00:15:55,200
but her brain CT scan

260
00:15:55,360 --> 00:15:56,360
showed nothing abnormal.

261
00:15:56,680 --> 00:15:57,720
There's no sign of poisoning either.

262
00:15:58,400 --> 00:15:58,800
Wait.

263
00:15:59,160 --> 00:16:00,480
Does she have a history
of heart problems?

264
00:16:01,960 --> 00:16:02,880
Xiyu.

265
00:16:03,800 --> 00:16:04,720
Xiyu.

266
00:16:05,400 --> 00:16:06,680
Mom's right here.

267
00:16:07,760 --> 00:16:09,800
What's happening, Xiyu?

268
00:16:11,720 --> 00:16:12,160
Quick!

269
00:16:12,200 --> 00:16:12,880
Get her into resus!

270
00:16:13,080 --> 00:16:13,720
Xiyu!

271
00:16:13,880 --> 00:16:14,520
Xiyu!

272
00:16:14,720 --> 00:16:15,680
- Xiyu!
- Stay with me!

273
00:16:17,800 --> 00:16:18,200
Wait.

274
00:16:18,200 --> 00:16:18,880
Hold on.

275
00:16:19,600 --> 00:16:21,080
Her heart rate is coming back up.

276
00:16:26,560 --> 00:16:27,200
Xiyu?

277
00:16:30,360 --> 00:16:31,000
Xiyu.

278
00:16:31,800 --> 00:16:32,480
Xiyu.

279
00:16:34,360 --> 00:16:35,240
Xiyu.

280
00:16:38,520 --> 00:16:39,240
Xiyu...

281
00:16:47,160 --> 00:16:48,120
Her heart rate's rising.

282
00:16:48,960 --> 00:16:49,600
Xiyu.

283
00:16:50,120 --> 00:16:51,040
It's going up again.

284
00:16:51,480 --> 00:16:52,160
(Xiyu...)

285
00:16:52,280 --> 00:16:53,120
(Xiyu...)

286
00:16:54,400 --> 00:16:59,280
♪I hide my racing heart without a sound♪

287
00:17:01,200 --> 00:17:05,840
♪I close my eyes and pretend
the story's been reset♪

288
00:17:07,320 --> 00:17:09,960
♪I steer clear of every path
that leads to you♪

289
00:17:10,320 --> 00:17:13,120
♪Trying to outrun the storm
we're destined for♪

290
00:17:13,800 --> 00:17:16,040
♪I thought if I didn't hear, see,
or speak of you♪

291
00:17:16,040 --> 00:17:19,520
♪I could cut every thread
that ties us together♪

292
00:17:20,680 --> 00:17:25,760
♪Through the endless night,
I guard my only secret♪

293
00:17:27,240 --> 00:17:32,320
♪In this new cycle, I watch you
become innocent again♪

294
00:17:33,440 --> 00:17:35,600
♪I tried to erase the fire we once had♪

295
00:17:35,600 --> 00:17:39,480
♪But I can't erase your name
carved into my bones♪

296
00:17:40,080 --> 00:17:42,320
♪The more I try to leave you behind♪

297
00:17:42,320 --> 00:17:46,440
♪The deeper I sink with no end in sight♪

298
00:17:46,600 --> 00:17:49,320
♪What if I stayed a little farther away♪

299
00:17:49,320 --> 00:17:52,720
♪Could I finally break free
from this cycle♪

300
00:17:53,120 --> 00:17:55,120
♪What if I took things a little slower♪

301
00:17:55,120 --> 00:17:59,120
♪Could I delay the moment
everything falls apart♪

302
00:17:59,360 --> 00:18:03,200
♪Maybe if I retreat to the edge
of my dreams♪

303
00:18:03,200 --> 00:18:06,240
♪I could give you another future♪

304
00:18:06,440 --> 00:18:12,680
♪A tomorrow where I no longer exist♪

305
00:18:12,680 --> 00:18:15,000
♪Even if I never want to see you again♪

306
00:18:15,000 --> 00:18:16,640
♪This nightmare still won't end♪

307
00:18:16,640 --> 00:18:18,400
♪Even if it all plays out again♪

308
00:18:18,400 --> 00:18:20,680
♪I'll still find my way back to you♪

309
00:18:20,680 --> 00:18:24,680
♪Even if having you only leaves me
in your debt♪

310
00:18:24,680 --> 00:18:25,640
♪It's still better than
losing you forever♪

311
00:18:25,640 --> 00:18:32,400
♪It's still better than
losing you forever♪

312
00:18:32,400 --> 00:18:38,840
♪I don't want an eternity without you♪

313
00:18:38,840 --> 00:18:41,600
♪Even if holding on is more dangerous♪

314
00:18:41,720 --> 00:18:43,280
♪More dangerous than letting go♪

315
00:18:43,280 --> 00:18:46,480
♪At least we were real in this moment♪

316
00:18:46,560 --> 00:18:50,160
♪At least none of this was pretend♪

317
00:18:50,160 --> 00:18:52,280
♪In every life where I have you♪

318
00:18:52,280 --> 00:18:58,000
♪I choose you in every lifetime
and every day♪

319
00:18:58,000 --> 00:18:59,920
♪What if I stayed a little farther away♪

320
00:18:59,920 --> 00:19:01,960
♪Is nothing but a poor attempt
to fool myself♪

321
00:19:01,960 --> 00:19:04,000
♪If I could really stay away♪

322
00:19:04,000 --> 00:19:05,840
♪Then this wouldn't be longing♪

323
00:19:05,840 --> 00:19:08,040
♪If every time I wake up♪

324
00:19:08,040 --> 00:19:10,421
♪I still end up falling for you♪
